  {
   "id": "P7",
   "type": "proposition",
   "name": null,
   "statement": "$|AB| = |AC|$ in $\\triangle~ABC$. $AB$ is extended to $D$, and $AC$ is extended to $E$. Then, $\\angle~ABC = \\angle~ACB$ and $\\angle~CBD = \\angle~BCE$.",
